  m_Name: SeaTrawlerPort
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaTrawlerPort
  displayName: Trawler Port
  description: A concrete quay with an ice plant and big diesel stern trawlers that
    fish shoals far out (16 tiles). A huge catch where the shoals are rich, little
    where they aren't. Its boats go out to the fish shoals in reach (silver glints
    on the water); the richer they are, the bigger the catch. Shoals fished hard
    thin out and move on, and regrow when left alone.
